            "text": "Parts department, this is Mike. Hey Mike, Steve transferred me over. I wanted to check if you have the aftermarket cat in stock for the Outback. Let me look. What year? 2019. Yeah we've got one from Walker. Ships overnight from our warehouse. Great. Steve said about $800 installed? That's right, $800 with the 2-year warranty. Perfect, go ahead and order it. Will do. We'll have it by tomorrow morning.",
